# D3-MI-008: Acid cleaning: metal consumption and oxide dissolution are not the same reaction
# Simulation candidate; no runtime observations are claimed.
register lv3
new
add v1 water 40mL
add v1 Fe 0.0005mol
add v2 water 40mL
add v2 Fe2O3 0.00025mol
seal v1 500mL
seal v2 500mL
add v1 HCl 0.002mol
add v2 HCl 0.002mol
wait 10min
measure v1 pressure
measure v2 pressure
particles v1
particles v2
inspect
